    "detailed_description": "Fish Survivor is a survival game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDive into an epic underwater world, where you'll start as a small fish and embark on an exciting survival journey. <br />\r\nHunt, feed and grow into super-sized sea creatures as you explore an amazing underwater playground, all while evolving and gaining new abilities along the way.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWatch as your fishy friend transforms and evolves into more powerful forms with unique abilities.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nJoin Fish Survivor and swim, munch, evolve, and gain new abilities on your way to becoming the coolest fish in the sea. <br />\r\nIt's time for an underwater adventure like no other!",
